---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { t } from '../../../i18n/t.js';
import tData from '../../../i18n/translations/pt.json';

const lang = 'pt';
const region = 'br';
---

<BaseLayout
  t={tData}
  title="Automação de Marketing para Academias | DUSA.studio"
  description="Reduza a evasao de alunos, automatize lembretes de aulas e cresca sua academia com rastreamento de indicacoes e campanhas de recuperacao. O DUSA e a plataforma de crescimento completa para negocios fitness."
>
  <!-- ═══ Hero ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-hero section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-hero__content">
        <span class="label">Academias e Fitness</span>
        <h1>Lote suas aulas.<br/>Mantenha seus <span class="gradient-text">alunos</span>.</h1>
        <p class="ind-hero__sub">
          Academias perdem alunos quando a comunicacao cai e o acompanhamento falha. O DUSA automatiza cada ponto de contato que mantem os alunos engajados, motivados e voltando sempre.
        </p>
        <a href="/br/start" class="btn btn--primary">Comece Agora Gratis</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ Pain Points ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-pain section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">Parece familiar?</span></h2>
      <div class="ind-pain__cards">

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4" />
              <path d="M20 8v6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Evasao de alunos</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">Alunos cancelam porque se sentem invisiveis. Sem check-ins, sem marcos, sem motivo para ficar.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <line x1="18" y1="9" x2="18" y2="15" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Faltas e aulas vazias</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">Alunos agendam e esquecem. Vagas vazias custam dinheiro e acabam com a energia da aula.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z" />
              <path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Comunicacao manual de aulas</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">Enviar lembretes, mudancas de horario e atualizacoes manualmente desperica horas toda semana.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Sem sistema de indicacao</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">Seu melhor canal de marketing sao alunos satisfeitos, mas voce nao tem como rastrear ou recompensar indicacoes.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ Solution ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-solution section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Como o DUSA funciona para <span class="gradient-text">negocios fitness</span></h2>
      <p class="ind-solution__sub">Automatize cada etapa da jornada do aluno, da matricula a renovacao e alem.</p>
      <div class="ind-solution__grid">

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10a8 8 0 0 0-16 0c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Sequencias de onboarding de alunos</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Novos alunos recebem uma serie de boas-vindas com recomendacoes de aulas, apresentacao de professores e metas. Primeiras impressoes que ficam.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">SMS de lembrete de aulas</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Lembretes automaticos por SMS antes de cada aula agendada. Reduza faltas e mantenha a frequencia alta sem mover um dedo.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M1 4v6h6" />
              <path d="M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 2.13-9.36L1 10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Campanhas de recuperacao</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Quando um aluno para de aparecer, o DUSA aciona uma sequencia de reengajamento com ofertas, check-ins e sugestoes de aulas para traze-lo de volta.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Rastreamento de indicacoes</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">De aos alunos um link de indicacao exclusivo. Rastreie quem eles enviam, recompense automaticamente e veja sua comunidade crescer.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Automacao de avaliacoes</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Apos um marco do aluno ou sequencia de aulas, o DUSA solicita uma avaliacao no Google. Construa sua reputacao no piloto automatico.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ Pipeline ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-pipeline section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>O ciclo de vida do <span class="gradient-text">aluno</span></h2>
      <div class="ind-pipeline__track">

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">01</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Teste</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">Um novo prospect se inscreve para um teste. O DUSA envia a sequencia de boas-vindas e agenda a primeira aula.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">02</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Aluno Ativo</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">O aluno esta treinando regularmente. Automacoes de check-in e lembretes de aulas mantém o engajamento.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">03</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Em Risco</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">A frequencia cai. O DUSA sinaliza o aluno e aciona uma sequencia de check-in pessoal.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">04</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Recuperacao</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">O aluno sumiu. Uma campanha direcionada com ofertas e motivacao traz ele de volta pela porta.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">05</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Renovado</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">O aluno renova o compromisso. Recompensas de fidelidade sao ativadas e o ciclo continua.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">06</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Campeao de Indicacoes</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">Membros leais ganham recompensas por trazer amigos. O rastreamento de indicacoes e campanhas de bonus fazem sua comunidade crescer automaticamente.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ Stats ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-stats section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-stats__grid">

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">67%</span>
          <span class="ind-stats__label">dos alunos de academia cancelam por falta de engajamento</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">3x</span>
          <span class="ind-stats__label">maior retencao com check-ins automaticos</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">40%</span>
          <span class="ind-stats__label">dos novos alunos vem de indicacoes</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
  <section class="ind-cta section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-cta__box">
        <h2>Pronto para crescer sua academia?</h2>
        <p>Pare de perder alunos por falta de comunicacao. Deixe o DUSA cuidar dos follow-ups, lembretes e reengajamento para que voce possa focar no que importa: treinar.</p>
        <div class="ind-cta__actions">
          <a href="/br/start" class="btn btn--primary">Comece Agora</a>
          <a href="/blog/marketing-automation-for-gyms" class="ind-cta__link">Leia o guia &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ Structured Data ═══ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://dusa.studio/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Setores", "item": "https://dusa.studio/br/industries/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Academias e Fitness", "item": "https://dusa.studio/br/industries/gyms" }
    ]
  })} />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .ind-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-3xl));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .ind-hero__content {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ind-hero__sub {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Pain Points */
  .ind-pain {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-pain h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ind-pain__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ind-pain__card {
    background: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-pain__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .ind-pain__icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-pain__icon-wrap svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
  }
  .ind-pain__card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pain__card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
  }

  /* Solution */
  .ind-solution {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-solution h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-solution__sub {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.125rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .ind-solution__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ind-solution__card {
    background: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-solution__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .ind-solution__icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-solution__icon-wrap svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
  }
  .ind-solution__card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-solution__card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
  }

  /* Pipeline */
  .ind-pipeline {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-pipeline h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__track {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ind-pipeline__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    opacity: 0.3;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.55);
  }

  /* Stats */
  .ind-stats {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-stats h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ind-stats__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ind-stats__card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
  }
  .ind-stats__number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-stats__label {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .ind-cta {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .ind-cta__box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
  }
  .ind-cta__box h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-cta__box p {
    font-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 2vw, 1.0625rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .ind-cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-cta__link {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-cta__link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ind-pain__cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ind-pain__cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-solution__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-pipeline__track {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-stats__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ind-hero {
      padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-2xl));
      padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .ind-pipeline__track {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-pain__card,
    .ind-solution__card,
    .ind-stats__card {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-cta__box {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-cta__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  /* Light Mode */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-hero__content h1,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline__step-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-cta__box h2 {
    color: var(--deep-ocean);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-hero__sub,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__sub,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline__step-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats__label,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-cta__box p {
    color: rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.65);
  }

